  "grammar": "Pin each accepted complete native/intake record and audit by exact digest; do not repeat completed A12B generation/audit/tests. Derive current paid task and immutable original controller prefix, reject any older unresolved owned need. Add only this fresh task as pending in a local demand projection. Use unchanged form_request. Canonical one default-role SelectionRequest; workflow every nonempty subset of current paid matching c7w.data content of size<=8. No external operands, successful route, labels, skill or outcome supplied. All optional material/social roles absent, explicitly not complete future role coverage. Derive actual recall32 traverse for task cue/context; record exact visited tuple/truncation/task membership without suppressing failure.",
  "native": "New engine schemas and CueComparisonRequest; preserve existing native policy rows and nominees. Reuse original paid window lifecycle with new source validation and policy identifier, never override existing selector. Snapshot and compare all 33 canonical/32 workflow cells per legal request including deferral/rejections. Required comparison cost is unchanged exact per-window native extent, summed over complete declared grammar. Native energy/time advances pay every unit; no result before settlement, no refund on cancellation. Snapshot predates debit. No route execution, reserve/history/preparation credit, current admission or choice authority.",
  "records": "40 exact records: each setting mask1 before/partial1/ready-uncommitted/complete plus exact saved partial restart completion and saved partial cancellation; masks2..15 complete. Preserve terminal idempotence result. Each primary runs once; control forks start only from saved partial. Persist atomic exclusive raw and independent backup, fsync, byte/typed readback before any next stage. Separate exclusive generation/audit/test/finish job boundaries, save outputs before validation, never replay completed stages. Unknown interruption needs separate prospective recovery.",
  "independent_audit": "Independently rebuild demand fields, oldest-first constraint, owned content grammar via bit masks, recall traversal via own bounded BFS and snapshot rows via existing independent native reference functions. Reconstruct entire native/source/command/access/pool/policy/cost/result/receipt suffix. No imports of new runtime, selectors or executor in auditor; record structures and reference auditors allowed. Require unchanged view/profile/cursor/access and old journal/command prefix. Verify all frozen source identities before/after. Reuse accepted identities, not accepted paid work.",
  "methods": [
    "test_complete_panel",
    "test_partial_ready_receipts",
    "test_exact_restart",
    "test_cancellation_debits",
    "test_prefixes_recall_scope",
    "test_wrong_input_domain_rejected",
    "test_forgery_rejected",
    "test_terminal_idempotence"
  ],
  "forgeries": "For each setting mask1 reject wrong native/intake/task/mask, omitted request, foreign operand/domain, altered current cue/controller/recall, payment/required, partial result/receipt, policy nominee and execution authority. Tests use saved records only.",
  "failure_policy": "Preserve all source/log/output; register concrete repair before changed code, freeze before bounded rerun. No unchanged identical-failure retry or accepted replay. No weakening FT8/native payments/authority, old demand requirements, source or denominator.",
  "operations": "Expected-head main claim and 30minute lease, full-tree exact verification each save, bounded jobs with >=300seconds lease/deadline before launch. All unrelated paths preserved. Independent audits may run serially to bound memory. No new automation.",
  "new_files": [
    "full_theory/cue_comparison.py",
    "full_theory/cue_comparison_audit.py",
    "tools/evaluate_ft7_cue_comparison.py",
    "tests_ft7/test_cue_comparison.py"
  ],
  "ft8_unchanged": true,
  "no_old_gate_replay": true
}
